  "name": "Board in Adafruit Feather format",
  "description": "A 50.8 x 22.86 mm board in the Adafruit Feather format, for Feather mainboards and FeatherWings, which share the outline. The USB end is at the left (X = 0). The male headers are on the bottom. Adafruit plates the two mounting holes at the USB end; swap in plated holes there if you need them. Adafruit and Feather are used only to describe compatibility.",
